Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:29:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] FileChooser: preview panel for the selected file

GTK 4 dropped the file chooser preview widget. Open dialogs now get a
panel on the right, like the preview column of the macOS Finder: the
selected image at full size, or the type icon for other files, with
name, type, dimensions and size. GTK 4 has no selection signal, so the
selection is polled every 150 ms and the file is loaded off the main
thread.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
